@startuml
skinparam style strictuml

[*] --> OperacionNormal

OperacionNormal --> AjusteBarras : keff > 1.05 o keff < 0.95
AjusteBarras --> OperacionNormal : keff en banda [0.95, 1.05]

OperacionNormal --> SCRAM : coolant_temp_celsius > 350.0
AjusteBarras --> SCRAM : coolant_temp_celsius > 350.0

SCRAM : scram_active = true
SCRAM : control_rods_pct = 100%
SCRAM --> Enfriamiento : coolant_temp_celsius <= 350.0

Enfriamiento --> OperacionNormal : operador reduce barras < 100%
Enfriamiento --> SCRAM : coolant_temp_celsius > 350.0

@enduml

